{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果首款摺疊屏手機 iPhone Duo 上市僅數小時，就有用户報告內屏出現裂紋、黑斑和異常亮線。隨着相關故障照片和視頻在社交媒體上不斷傳播，這一問題開始被外界稱為「Crackgate」。最新拆解分析指出，問題可能出在手機內部複雜的鉸鏈結構上：當手機摺疊時，鉸鏈中的金屬支撐部件可能沒有充分收回，從而擠壓脆弱的柔性屏幕，在特定位置形成應力集中，最終導致屏幕破裂。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584162.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T09:02:08.209657+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":186,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T08:42:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T08:58:15.396774+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T08:58:15.396774+00:00","content_hash":"863612136a90e8fedd73d289033183cf0c9c7bcec4b89ba92df5d584282886cc","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}